{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/862f1cbdbe55d520f139afb29475cd65.poster.avif?t=1758830023\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/862f1cbdbe55d520f139afb29475cd65.webm?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/862f1cbdbe55d520f139afb29475cd65.mp4?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are C3V1N, a broken cleaning unit trapped in the dystopian metropolis of Pioneer. With every beat, you fight your way out\u2014one perfectly timed shot at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/dd7269e7ea63d02dd3ae7f678d2038a3.poster.avif?t=1758830023\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/dd7269e7ea63d02dd3ae7f678d2038a3.webm?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/dd7269e7ea63d02dd3ae7f678d2038a3.mp4?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power is tied to the tempo. Shooting, dashing, and reloading in sync with the heart-pounding electronic score unleashes devastating damage and keeps you alive in the fray. Miss the beat, and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your skills to the limit across intense, hand-crafted levels and face off against colossal biomechanical bosses. Master your run, climb the global leaderboards, and etch your name into the digital annals of the cyberpunk metropolis, Pioneer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official soundtrack is a brutal electronic onslaught, but your music library is your arsenal. The revolutionary music import feature lets you weaponize any song and will let you play in a procedurally generated level that will let you feel the song's crescendo or the beat drop. Systematically dismantle the corporate machine to the brutal beat of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/0e28c5470c5b20e8475ad979b84b9d94.poster.avif?t=1758830023\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/0e28c5470c5b20e8475ad979b84b9d94.webm?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/0e28c5470c5b20e8475ad979b84b9d94.mp4?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneer is a dying world of chrome and sin. Experience a visceral, high-octane campaign through a dystopian metropolis brought to life with brutalist cyberpunk architecture and blistering visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BEAT NEVER STOPS. NEITHER DO YOU.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/4a64ca74a55e0606dd5c1222e9a08c87.poster.avif?t=1758830023\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/4a64ca74a55e0606dd5c1222e9a08c87.webm?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/4a64ca74a55e0606dd5c1222e9a08c87.mp4?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3080360?t=1758830023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/862f8ac711e6ac7ec7a5f0a6184fa6d1a1c4ddfa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758830023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/0c1fa6600ea7d298d06c3db2a4b7341bad47a3ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758830023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/0c1fa6600ea7d298d06c3db2a4b7341bad47a3ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758830023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/862f1cbdbe55d520f139afb29475cd65.poster.avif?t=1758830023\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/862f1cbdbe55d520f139afb29475cd65.webm?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080360/extras/862f1cbdbe55d520f139afb29475cd65.mp4?t=1758830023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are C3V1N, a broken cleaning unit trapped in the dystopian metropolis of Pioneer.